<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20395" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Helvētĭi</span></b> ,
			ōrum, m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the Helvetians</i>, <i>a people of</i> Gallia Lugdunensis, in modern <i>Switzerland</i>, <i><span class="en">Caes. B. G. 1, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4</span></i>
			sq.; <i><span class="en">Tac. G.
				28</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. H. 1, 67</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 17,
				31, § 106</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Prov.
				Cons. 13, 33</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Balb. 14, 32</span></i> et saep.
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Derivv.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Helvētĭus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>of</i>
			or <i>belonging to the Helvetians</i>, <i>Helvetian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes. B.
					G. 1, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">civitas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 12</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Helvētĭcus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., the same: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">proelium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. G. 7, 9, 6</span></i>
			. 
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
